>
  <p>A walkway is a small surface with a big job: it guides every visitor to your door and it has to stay even and safe through decades of freeze-thaw. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> pours front, side and backyard walkways across Toronto and the GTA, straight runs and gentle curves alike.</p>

  <p>Walkways fail when water gets under them. We excavate to a proper depth, compact a granular base, and grade the surface so water sheds to the side instead of pooling or running at your foundation. That prep is what keeps the joints from heaving when the frost comes.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our concrete walkway service</h2>
  <p>Every walkway job is priced as a complete package in a written quote:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Layout and design</strong>, straight or curved to suit the yard</li>
    <li><strong>Removal of the old walkway</strong> where there is one, with disposal included</li>
    <li><strong>Excavation and a compacted granular base</strong></li>
    <li><strong>A broom finish</strong> for grip in wet and icy weather</li>
    <li><strong>Control joints</strong> placed to keep any shrinkage cracking where we planned it</li>
    <li><strong>Full cleanup</strong> when the job is done</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Walkways, sidewalks, steps, done together</h2>
  <p>Front walkways usually meet a <a href="/services/concrete-sidewalks/">sidewalk</a> at one end and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a> at the other. If any of those need work, bundling them into one visit means one quote and one schedule, and the finishes match. We will price the bundle honestly: if a section only needs a <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a>, we say so.</p>

  <h2>Why homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>We have poured concrete across Toronto for 15 years, hundreds of jobs from single walkways to full frontages. You get a written price, a schedule we stick to, and a 2-year warranty on the finished work.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every pour</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We pour walkways across the whole GTA, from downtown Toronto to <a href="/locations/oshawa/">Oshawa</a> and <a href="/locations/richmond-hill/">Richmond Hill</a>. See every area on our <a href="/locations/">service areas</a> page.</p>
